@startuml
[*] --> StartBooking
StartBooking --> SelectTravelMode: User selects travel mode and destination
SelectTravelMode --> InputTravelDates: User inputs travel dates and preferred mode
InputTravelDates --> GenerateOptions: System generates available options
GenerateOptions --> SelectOption: User selects preferred option
SelectOption --> ReviewOptions: User reviews options
ReviewOptions --> SubmitBooking: User submits booking info
SubmitBooking --> CheckAvailability: System checks availability
CheckAvailability --> ConfirmBooking: System confirms booking
ConfirmBooking --> SendConfirmation: System sends email
SendConfirmation --> [*]
@enduml
